# Qwen 4 Max — excluded by Beam

- Source: Beam (opencode/beam-free)
- Date: 2026-11-11 (UTC)
- Overview and scoring methodology: `../../model-comparison.md`
- Status: **excluded — no verified public benchmark numbers for "Qwen 4 Max"**; no scores reported.

## Model card

- **Claimed name:** Qwen 4 Max (folder slug `qwen-4-max`, id `alibaba/qwen-4-max`). Vendor markets the Max-class route as "Qwen3.8-Max" (proprietary 2.4T MoE flagship, 1M context, $2.00/$6.00 per 1M; QwenCloud/Alibaba Cloud Model Studio).
- **Finding:** Proprietary Max-class route served via QwenCloud (`qwen3.8-max`) and Alibaba Cloud Model Studio (`qwen4-max-preview`). QwenCloud lists specs (1,048,576 total context, 131,072 max output, $2.00/$6.00 per 1M, text+image in, text out) but no standardized benchmark table in accessible text for this exact ID. The open-weight Qwen3.8 family (2.4T-A95B, 27B) publishes benchmark figures on the Qwen3.8 GitHub README/model cards, but those belong to the open checkpoints, not the Max-class proprietary route, and are not transferable to this ID. No Artificial Analysis / BenchLM / SWE-bench Verified / Terminal-Bench / GPQA row found for `qwen-4-max` / `qwen3.8-max` in accessible text.
- **Context window / modalities / pricing:** 1,048,576 total; 131,072 max output; text + image in, text out; $2.00 / $6.00 per 1M (QwenCloud published pricing).

### Raw benchmarks found

- No verified public benchmark score found for Qwen 4 Max in any first-party or independent source in accessible text: QwenCloud and Alibaba Cloud Model Studio publish specs and pricing only; the Qwen3.8 GitHub README benchmark figures belong to the open-weight checkpoints, not the Max-class proprietary route; no Artificial Analysis / BenchLM / SWE-bench / Terminal-Bench / GPQA row for this exact ID.

